<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Demand was moderate to good. Top $58.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 56.50-57.50, few 58.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>		 400-500 lbs. 44.00-48.00</p>
<p>		 500-600 lbs. 48.00-51.00</p>
<p>		 few over 600 lbs. 50.00-53.00</p>
</text>
